---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";

const PAYHIP_CELPIP_URL = "/ebook";
---

<Layout
  title="CELPIP Course — IELTS Corner"
  description="Simple, clear CELPIP prep for CLB 7–10. Step-by-step strategies, templates, and practice for all four skills."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="hero" style={`--hero-bg: url('/heroes/celpip.png');`}>
      <div class="hero-content">
        <span class="pill">🇨🇦 CELPIP • CLB 7–10</span>

        <h1>Get the CELPIP course. Improve faster with clear steps.</h1>

        <p class="muted" style="max-width: 56ch;">
          This course shows you what to do in the test — with simple language, clear templates, and real practice.
        </p>

        <div class="cluster" style="margin-top: var(--s-2);">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href={PAYHIP_CELPIP_URL}>
            View CELPIP course options →
          </a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/tutoring">Private or group lessons →</a>
        </div>

        <div style="height: var(--s-4);"></div>

        <!-- 4 skill buttons -->
        <div class="cluster">
          <a class="btn" href="/celpip/listening">Listening</a>
          <a class="btn" href="/celpip/reading">Reading</a>
          <a class="btn" href="/celpip/speaking">Speaking</a>
          <a class="btn" href="/celpip/writing">Writing</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="height: var(--s-8);"></div>

    <div class="surface" style="padding: var(--s-6);">
      <h2>Official CELPIP-General format (quick view)</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-2">
        <div>
          <h3>Listening</h3>
          <p class="muted">47–55 minutes • 6 parts (+ possible unscored items)</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Reading</h3>
          <p class="muted">55–60 minutes • 4 parts (+ possible unscored items)</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Writing</h3>
          <p class="muted">53–60 minutes • 2 tasks (Email + Survey response)</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Speaking</h3>
          <p class="muted">15–20 minutes • 8 tasks</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="muted" style="margin-top: var(--s-3);">Source: CELPIP-General Overview Participant Package (2022).</p>
    </div>

    <div style="height: var(--s-8);"></div>

    <div class="surface feature">
      <div class="feature-grid">
        <div class="stack">
          <h2>Who this is for</h2>
          <p class="muted" style="max-width: 58ch;">
            If you feel “stuck,” you probably don’t need harder vocabulary. You need structure: what to say first, next,
            and last — and how to avoid common mistakes.
          </p>

          <div class="cluster" style="margin-top: var(--s-2);">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href={PAYHIP_CELPIP_URL}>
              See course details →
            </a>
            <a class="btn" href="/tutoring">Lessons & pricing →</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="checklist">
          <div class="check">
            <div class="icon">✓</div>
            <div>
              <strong>Simple templates</strong>
              <span>Use the same structure for many topics.</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="check">
            <div class="icon">✓</div>
            <div>
              <strong>Clear examples</strong>
              <span>Easy-to-understand English.</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="check">
            <div class="icon">✓</div>
            <div>
              <strong>Practice that matches the test</strong>
              <span>So nothing feels “new” on exam day.</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="height: var(--s-8);"></div>

    <div class="grid grid-2">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Want a plan?</h3>
        <p class="muted">Book one lesson. I will build your study plan and show you what to fix first.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/tutoring">View pricing →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>Want to start now?</h3>
        <p class="muted">Review the course page first, then start with the skill that matches your weakest section.</p>
        <a class="btn" href={PAYHIP_CELPIP_URL}>Open course page →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
